      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm trying to help my teenage daughter understand some of the stuff she's hearing in school and online. Can you explain what the scientific consensus is regarding gender identity and how it relates to biological sex? I want to make sure I'm giving her the most accurate info.",
